---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import SubHero from "../../components/SubHero.astro";
import Icon from "../../components/Icon.astro";
import { PHONE, PHONE_TEL, SALES_EMAIL } from "../../data/contact";
---

<Base
	title="About Lucoze — Healthcare technology built in India"
	description="Lucoze is built by Svasamm Research Pvt. Ltd. We're a small team building clinic software that respects the front desk and keeps patient data in India."
>
	<SubHero
		crumbs={[{ href: "/in/", label: "Home" }, { label: "About" }]}
		eyebrow="About Lucoze"
		h1="Making world-class healthcare software accessible to every Indian clinic."
		highlightParts={[
			"Making world-class healthcare software accessible to ",
			"every Indian clinic",
			".",
		]}
		lead="A small team of healthcare technologists building the clinic software we'd want our own families to use. Hosted in India. Founder-led. No private equity."
		primaryCta={{ href: "/in/contact/", label: "Get in touch" }}
	/>

	<section class="section section--tight">
		<div class="container">
			<article class="post" style="margin: 0 auto;">
				<h2 id="story">Our story</h2>
				<p>
					Lucoze was founded by healthcare professionals and technologists who watched the painful
					gap between expensive enterprise systems and the spreadsheets most Indian clinics were
					forced to rely on. Doctors were spending more time wrestling with software than caring for
					patients. Lab technicians were printing results and manually filing them. Pharmacists were
					tracking inventory on paper.
				</p>
				<p>
					We set out to change that. Our mission is to give every clinic, hospital, diagnostic
					centre, and pharmacy in India access to the same powerful tools that were once reserved
					for large hospital chains with crore-rupee IT budgets.
				</p>

				<h2 id="mission">Our mission</h2>
				<p>
					Every healthcare facility, regardless of size or location, deserves software that
					understands its workflow. From a solo clinic in Patna to a sprawling 80-bed hospital in
					Kolkata, Lucoze adapts to the way Indian healthcare is actually delivered — across every
					specialty, every scale, every language. Our goal is simple: let healthcare professionals
					focus on patients, not paperwork.
				</p>

				<h2 id="values">What we believe</h2>
			</article>

			<div class="module-grid" style="max-width: 720px; margin: var(--s-6) auto var(--s-10);">
				<article class="module-card">
					<div class="module-card__icon">
						<Icon name="shield" size={20} />
					</div>
					<div class="module-card__title">Healthcare first</div>
					<div class="module-card__blurb">
						Every feature is designed with healthcare workflows in mind — for doctors, front desk
						staff, lab technicians, and pharmacists.
					</div>
				</article>
				<article class="module-card">
					<div class="module-card__icon">
						<Icon name="lock" size={20} />
					</div>
					<div class="module-card__title">Privacy by design</div>
					<div class="module-card__blurb">
						Patient data security is non-negotiable. End-to-end encryption, India data residency,
						strict access controls — built into every layer.
					</div>
				</article>
				<article class="module-card">
					<div class="module-card__icon">
						<Icon name="cloud" size={20} />
					</div>
					<div class="module-card__title">India first, then the region</div>
					<div class="module-card__blurb">
						We start with what Indian clinics need (Hindi UI, ABDM, GST) and expand. No half-baked
						"international features" tacked on later.
					</div>
				</article>
			</div>

			<article class="post" style="margin: 0 auto;">
				<h2 id="company">The company</h2>
				<p>
					Lucoze is built by <strong>Svasamm Research Pvt. Ltd.</strong>, a technology company based
					in Konnagar, Hooghly, West Bengal — serving clinics and hospitals across West Bengal,
					Bihar, Jharkhand, Odisha, Uttar Pradesh and Northeast India. Our team combines deep
					healthcare domain expertise with modern software engineering to create products that
					healthcare professionals actually enjoy using.
				</p>
				<p>
					Founded in 2024 and led by <strong>Mithun K. Singh</strong> (<a
						href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mithunksingh"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a
					>). Find Lucoze on <a
						href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/113023331/"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a
					>, <a href="https://x.com/lucozehq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X</a>, and <a
						href="https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/lucoze"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener">Crunchbase</a
					>.
				</p>
				<p>
					Want to get in touch? Reach us at <a href={`mailto:${SALES_EMAIL}`}>{SALES_EMAIL}</a> or
					<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`}>{PHONE}</a>, or <a href="/in/demo/">book a demo</a>.
				</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>
</Base>
